    subgraph TravelFlows [Travel & Lifestyle Hub]
        TabTravel --> FlightSearch[Flight Search & Booking]
        TabTravel --> HotelSearch[Hotel Search & Reservation]
        TabTravel --> ESIMScreen[eSIM Packages & Activation]
        TabTravel --> BoatScreen[Boat Tours & Yacht Booking]
        TabTravel --> DiningScreen[Dining Vouchers & Passes]
        FlightSearch --> TravelCheckout[Travel Checkout Screen]
        TravelCheckout --> TravelVoucher[Voucher & Boarding Pass]
    end

    subgraph SettingsFlows [Settings, Support & KYC]
        TabSettings --> KYCVerification[Identity Verification / KYC Tier]
